1. Permitted
   - Anyone may use this web app free of charge.
   - Anyone may freely share links to the web app.
   - Screenshots and videos of the app may be recorded and shared.
   - Users may submit authors and mentions through the "add" feature.

2. Prohibited without prior written permission from the copyright holder
   - Copying, modifying, or redistributing the source code, design, text,
     or the compiled dataset (the selection, arrangement, and annotation
     of authors and mentions), in whole or in part
   - Using this web app or any part of it in another project, service,
     or product
   - Presenting this web app as one's own work or re-hosting it elsewhere
   - Any commercial use

3. Quotations and titles from other writers belong to their respective
   copyright holders and are quoted with attribution. This license claims
   no rights over them.

4. Under the GitHub Terms of Service, code in a public repository may be
   viewed and forked within GitHub. This does not grant any of the rights
   listed in section 2.

5. This web app and its data are provided "as is", without warranty of any
   kind. Please verify each mention against the source shown.

For permission requests: https://github.com/yangduckduck-source
